      "subSection": "Section A",
      "type": "mcq",
      "text": "The percentage errors in the measurement of mass and speed are 2% and 3% respectively. The maximum percentage error in the estimation of kinetic energy is :",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "8%"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "5%"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "11%"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "12%"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "A",
      "solution": "K = \\frac{1}{2}m v^2 \\implies \\frac{\\Delta K}{K} = \\frac{\\Delta m}{m} + 2\\frac{\\Delta v}{v} = 2% + 2(3%) = 8%."
    },
    {
