      "section": "Physics",
      "subSection": "Section A",
      "type": "mcq",
      "text": "A particle moves along the x-axis such that its position is x = 2t^3 - 9t^2 + 12t + 5 m. The particle momentarily comes to rest at times t_1 and t_2. The sum t_1 + t_2 is :",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "3 s"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "4.5 s"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "6 s"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "1.5 s"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "A",
      "solution": "v = 6t^2 - 18t + 12 = 0 \\implies t^2 - 3t + 2 = 0 \\implies t_1 + t_2 = 3 s."
    },
